WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
I DON'T THINK THAT'S WHAT I

00:02.000 --> 00:03.000
THINK.

00:03.000 --> 00:04.000
JAY HAS APOLOGIZED.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
THE STATEMENTS THAT HE MADE

00:06.000 --> 00:07.000
WERE INDEFENSIBLE.

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
BUT I'VE KNOWN JAY JONES FOR 25

00:09.000 --> 00:10.000
YEARS.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.000
I THINK THOSE STATEMENTS WERE

00:12.000 --> 00:13.000
NOT IN CHARACTER.

00:13.000 --> 00:14.000
AND HE HAS APOLOGIZED.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
I WISH OTHER PEOPLE IN PUBLIC

00:16.000 --> 00:17.000
