00:17.000 --> 00:18.000
FOR STUFF.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000
SO NO, I STILL AM A SUPPORTER.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
SO THE LEFT WILL CANCEL YOU

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
