00:26.000 --> 00:28.000
TELL YOU TO ELECT A GUY WHO SAYS

00:28.000 --> 00:29.000
HE WANTS REPUBLICANS CHILDREN TO

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
THEIR OWN OVERBOARD EVER AGAIN.

00:31.000 --> 00:33.000
THESE ARE THE NEW RULES.

00:33.000 --> 00:35.000
YOU CAN SAY ANYTHING AND SURVIVE.

